00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:45.899 size:53% position:73% line:53%
extrêmement prometteur.

00:02:43.964 --> 00:02:46.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Parce que ces petits drones

00:02:44.965 --> 00:02:49.169 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Switchblade, on ne peut pas

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:50.170 size:53% position:73% line:53%
