00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.205 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ni en infrarouge, donc

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:52.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les Russes vont être

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.240 size:53% position:73% line:53%
totalement vulnérables face

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:54.274 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à ces systèmes qui vont être

00:02:52.306 --> 00:02:55.275 size:53% position:73% line:53%
