00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.310 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Sur le terrain, réellement,

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:57.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'arrivée des Switchblade,

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:59.112 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ça peut transformer

00:02:56.410 --> 00:03:01.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la capacité offensive

00:02:57.411 --> 00:03:03.183 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'armée ukrainienne.

00:02:59.213 --> 00:03:04.184 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est une sorte de drone-ssss,

00:03:01.248 --> 00:03:05.185 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car il se détruit sur sa cible.

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:08.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il est tenu encore assez secret.

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:09.189 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ces armes, qui sont en train

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:11.792 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de changer l'art de la guerre,

00:03:08.122 --> 00:03:12.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont des effets dévastateurs

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:15.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour les Russes.

00:03:11.892 --> 00:03:16.163 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Si on ususususususususses ont

00:03:12.893 --> 00:03:17.197 size:53% position:73% line:53%
perdu quasiment 2000 blindés,

00:03:15.229 --> 00:03:19.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on peut se dire qu'il y a

00:03:16.263 --> 00:03:20.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au moins 8000 à 10 000 morts

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:21.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du côté russe.

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:22.336 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et ensuite, on a toujours

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:23.337 size:53% position:73% line:53%
deux à trois fois plus de

00:03:21.402 --> 00:03:24.438 size:53% position:73% line:53%
blessés que ce qu'on a de morts,

00:03:22.436 --> 00:03:25.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et c'est donc certainement

00:03:23.437 --> 00:03:26.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
30 000 à 40 000 personnes qui

00:03:24.538 --> 00:03:27.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
