00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:29.243 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aujourd'hui, sans compter

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:30.511 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ceux qui sont aujourd'hui

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:31.512 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enfermés dans certaines poches.

00:03:29.343 --> 00:03:32.513 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Vous savez, par exemple...

00:03:30.611 --> 00:03:34.214 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(inaudible)

00:03:31.612 --> 00:03:35.215 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... il y a eu une contre-

00:03:32.613 --> 00:03:37.251 size:53% position:73% line:53%
offensive ukrainienne

00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:38.252 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui a certainement bloqué

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:39.286 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des milliers de Russes quisont t

