mais à cause de la puissance

00:03:45.426 --> 00:03:49.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de son armée, la Russie pourrait

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:51.865 size:53% position:73% line:53%
encore gagner la guerre,

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:52.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais pas la guerre

